<TR><TD bgcolor=2F4F2F><font size=+1 color=FFFFFF>6/13/00</font></TD></TR>
<TR><TD><font size=+1 color=FFFFFF>Site!! </font><font size=-1 color=FFFFFF>
</font>
<HR>
<font size=-1 color =FFFFFF><P>


Well since I have the week off I am going to get to level 45 and get this site done. :) <br>
Ganza and I have it almost complete and it looks damn good I think. <br>

I'd like to say also we had one brave soul offer his help and it looks like he will be joining the team here. We'll see in the upcoming hours. <br>
We still have a couple openings if anyone is interested to help out on the site, ie; adding news articles, revising the spells, guilds, and soon to have the message board up and hosted by us. Unfortunately, it won't have any of the registered users since that was a seperate host and person doing the boards.
<br>
See ya soon!
<BR>
 - Anumatu<BR><BR>
</P></font>
</TD></TR>

