</font>
<HR>
<font size=-1 color =FFFFFF><P>

I am going through and revising the guild page here, I'd like the guilds that are not included on there to send me an email at <a href="mailto:admin@solusekro.com">admin@solusekro.com</a> . Those guilds that no longer exist and are on there I would like to get rid of. If you see a guild that doesn't belong let me know also =).
